## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.95 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Control Default (Mid)

- Items: Magic Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Glowing Wand, Ice Queen Wand, Divine Glaive, Holy Crystal
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Glowing Wand, Ice Queen Wand
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Arcane Boots over Magic Boots when Use when the enemy mid cannot punish you early and flat Magic Penetration matters more than rotation frequency.; Wishing Lantern over Ice Queen Wand when Use when your team already has enough slows and Gord is free to channel into high-HP targets.; Blood Wings over Holy Crystal when Use when late fights are decided by whether Gord survives the first dive attempt after casting Mystic Gush.
- Total cost: 11840 gold

Default mid build for ranked games where Gord needs cooldown tempo, anti-sustain burn, and Ice Queen Wand slows to keep enemies inside his repeated skill hits.

### Frontline Melter (Mid)

- Items: Magic Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Glowing Wand, Wishing Lantern, Divine Glaive, Holy Crystal
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Glowing Wand, Wishing Lantern
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Ice Queen Wand over Holy Crystal when Use when enemy fighters can walk out of Mystic Injunction before Wishing Lantern damage matters.; Genius Wand over Wishing Lantern when Use when the enemy has low to moderate Magic Defense and your team benefits more from stacked shred than current-HP damage.; Blood Wings over Holy Crystal when Use when the enemy front line cannot kill you quickly but their assassin can punish every ultimate channel.
- Total cost: 12050 gold

Tank-killing setup for front-to-back drafts where Gord can repeatedly hit the same durable target and turn Mystic Gush into a high-HP punish tool.

### Anti-Dive Survival (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Ice Queen Wand, Winter Crown, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Ice Queen Wand, Winter Crown
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy dive threat is damage-heavy but not crowd-control-heavy enough to justify Fortitude.; Glowing Wand over Blood Wings when Use when sustain or shield heroes are the reason your team cannot finish targets after the first stun.; Immortality over Blood Wings when Use in late base or Lord defense when one failed Purify or Winter Crown timing would end the game.
- Total cost: 10790 gold

Defensive mid setup for hard engage, chain CC, and assassin drafts where Gord must survive the first lockout before his zone control matters.

